# Everything that must not enter the build context.
#
# The first entry is the important one. `.env` holds the signing key and the
# provider credentials; a COPY that picks it up bakes them into an image
# layer, where they survive being deleted in a later layer and travel with
# the image to every registry it is pushed to.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Secrets by other names.
*.pem
*.key
secrets/

# Local state that would otherwise be copied over the container's own.
var/
.venv/
venv/

# Noise: large, useless in the image, and a cache invalidation on every edit.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Tests and docs do not execute in the runtime image.
tests/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# Editor and OS droppings.
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
